sequenceDiagram
    participant Authority as Authority User
    participant Gate as eFTI Gate (<gateId>)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant GateFI as Remote Gate (<peerGateA>)
    participant GateDE as Remote Gate (<peerGateB>)
    participant GateSE as Remote Gate (<peerGateC>)

    Authority->>+Gate: GET /v1/identifiers/456XYZ?registrationCountryCode=FI
    Note over Authority,Gate: Accept: text/event-stream<br/>Authorization: Bearer <TARA-JWT, role=AUTHORITY><br/>X-Request-ID: req-b2c3d4e5

    Gate->>Gate: Validate JWT (signature, exp, iss, aud,<br/>not in `sessions` denylist);<br/>require resource_access.efti-gate.roles ∋ AUTHORITY

    Gate->>+DB: Local identifier search:<br/>resolve latest consignments rows matching vehicle_plate='456XYZ' AND vehicle_country='FI',<br/>keep only those whose latest status = 'active'.
    DB-->>-Gate: 0 results

    Note over Gate: Broadcast decision:<br/>local results = 0, forceBroadcast = false<br/>→ Broadcast to all ONLINE peer gates.

    Gate->>+DB: Resolve all peer gates whose latest row has status='ONLINE' and is_active=TRUE<br/>(excluding self).
    DB-->>-Gate: [<peerGateA>, <peerGateB>, <peerGateC>, <peerGateD>, <peerGateE>, <peerGateF>]

    Note over Gate: Open SSE stream to authority
    Gate-->>Authority: HTTP 200 OK (text/event-stream)

    Gate-->>Authority: event: gate\ndata: {"gateId":"<gateId>","responseTimeMs":6,"consignments":null}

    par Broadcast to all online gates (parallel, non-blocking)
        Gate->>+GateFI: eDelivery AS4 / Fast SOAP: IdentifierQueryRequest<br/>(id="456XYZ", countryCode="FI", requestId="req-b2c3d4e5")
        Gate->>+GateDE: eDelivery AS4 / Fast SOAP: IdentifierQueryRequest<br/>(id="456XYZ", countryCode="FI", requestId="req-b2c3d4e5")
        Gate->>+GateSE: eDelivery AS4 / Fast SOAP: IdentifierQueryRequest<br/>(id="456XYZ", countryCode="FI", requestId="req-b2c3d4e5")
    end

    GateFI->>GateFI: Query local DB, find 1 result
    GateFI-->>-Gate: IdentifierQueryResponse (1 consignment)

    Gate-->>Authority: event: gate\ndata: {"gateId":"<peerGateA>","responseTimeMs":187}
    Gate-->>Authority: event: consignment (id=a1b2c3d4-...)\ndata: {"vehicle":{"plate":"456XYZ","country":"FI"},"uil":{"gateId":"<peerGateA>","platformId":"<platformId>","datasetId":"a1b2c3d4-..."}}

    GateDE->>GateDE: Query local DB, 0 results
    GateDE-->>-Gate: IdentifierQueryResponse (0 consignments)

    Gate-->>Authority: event: gate\ndata: {"gateId":"<peerGateB>","responseTimeMs":203}

    GateSE->>GateSE: Query local DB, 0 results
    GateSE-->>-Gate: IdentifierQueryResponse (0 consignments)

    Gate-->>Authority: event: gate\ndata: {"gateId":"<peerGateC>","responseTimeMs":219}

    Note over Gate: All gates responded (or 8s timeout reached)

    Gate-->>Authority: event: complete\ndata: {}
    Gate-->>-Authority: SSE stream closed
    Note over Authority: Received 1 consignment from <peerGateA>.<br/>6 gates queried in ~220ms.
